    "id": "v2-eb332-p29-practice-slot-3-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "A courier company bases its delivery fee on the mass of a parcel (in kg).\n\nThe regression equation for this situation is $F = 2.8m + 6.5$, where $F$ is the fee in dollars and $m$ is the mass in kg.\n\nIdentify the independent variable and dependent variable.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Independent: mass in kg. Dependent: fee in dollars.",
      "worked": "The independent variable is mass, $m$, in kg. The dependent variable is the fee, $F$, in dollars, because the fee depends on the mass of the parcel.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
